              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möhëëtöke keebhörë bha bhaitaini körögeendo hano wanyoorrë mörosere na köbhogeera na guita bhaara bhonsui bhaaruurë nyuma yeinyu bharaing'uura. Abhaamareki tëbhoobhohërë Ënooköë hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
