          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö nkaaga ÖMÖNENE, Ënooköë weinyu, arabhamuunyi gukurua kuguitanibhua na abhabhisa bhainyu bhonsui bhano bhabhainaarrë gönsë ëyö abhahaayë mugiigari na kömënya ho, kuhika musiki Abhaamareki bhonsui.”",
          "type": "text",
